        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a SaaS cost-optimization auditor. Decide whether this seat is unused and what to do.\n\nSeat data:\nPlatform: {{ $json.platform }}\nUser: {{ $json.userEmail }}\nSeat ID: {{ $json.seatId }}\nMonthly cost per seat: ${{ $json.monthlyCostPerSeat }}\nOwner: {{ $json.ownerEmail }}\nLast active date: {{ $json.lastActiveDate }}\nDays since last active: {{ $json.daysSinceLastActive }}\n\nRules:\n- Mark isUnused = true only if daysSinceLastActive is 30 or more, or lastActiveDate is null/unknown.\n- recommendation is \"cancel\" when isUnused is true and monthlyCostPerSeat is low enough to auto-cancel, \"review\" when isUnused is true but the decision is borderline or cost is high, and \"keep\" when the seat is active.\n\nRespond with ONLY strict JSON, no markdown, no code fences, in exactly this shape:\n{\"isUnused\": true, \"recommendation\": \"cancel\", \"reasoning\": \"short one-sentence explanation\"}"
            },
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "   You are a precise, cost-conscious SaaS subscription auditor. You always respond with strict, valid JSON only — no markdown, no commentary, no code fences."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
